  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nI created this recipe to give images the impression of having captured the breezy atmosphere of a moment. With blue and green hues for a refreshing tone overall, this recipe keeps images as natural as possible for everyday scenes, and is also recommended for portraits because colors and textures are balanced to make people look healthy. I think it would also be good for images that include a significant amount of a natural landscape with plants, trees, and water. As images can easily be a little overexposed, applying slightly darker exposure settings, reducing the color temperature, and shifting colors in the green direction will make the most of the recipe's characteristics.",
